-- statement:
--   # Expression and law algebra, children of tangent patterns
--
--   Basic algebra of the formal expressions `Expr` (evaluation and safety of sums, products,
--   powers, substitutions, rational fractions) and of the formal laws `Law` (coefficients of
--   products, scalings, descents and flat maps), together with the elementary combinatorics of
--   the children of a tangent pattern and a handful of algebraic and topological facts used
--   throughout (coordinate cylinders, coprimality of reductions, ramification of local
--   extensions, finiteness of types of bounded degree).
--
--   ## Main results
--
--   * `TypeDensity.children_degree_identity`: `∑ e · deg(child) = deg(s)` over the children.
--   * `TypeDensity.children_valid`: children of a valid state are valid.
--   * `TypeDensity.expression_fraction`: evaluating a safe expression via its fraction.
--   * `TypeDensity.lawInterp_lawMul`, `TypeDensity.lawInterp_lawProd`: the interpretation of a
--     law in a monoid algebra (shared by the numerical and the rational-function readings) is
--     multiplicative.
--   * `TypeDensity.law_coeff_mul`, `TypeDensity.law_coeff_prod_formula`,
--     `TypeDensity.law_coeff_prod_descend`: coefficient formulas for products of laws.
--   * `TypeDensity.law_coeff_nonneg_closure`: nonnegativity of coefficients is preserved by
--     the law operations.
--   * `TypeDensity.coordinate_cylinder_clopen`: congruence cylinders are clopen.
--   * `TypeDensity.finite_flat_local_ramification_degree`: `e · f = rank` for finite flat
--     local extensions.
--
